						"aiid": 4
					}
				],
				"readmeComment": "Starts cooking with a JSON list of 7 values: time (minutes), temperature (degrees Celsius), food quantity (1 single layer, 2 double layer), keep warm after cooking (true or false), scheduled start time (minutes, 0 starts now), cooking weight (grams), recipe id. The recipe id is `M0` for manual cooking, `M1` to `M10` for the device presets or `C` plus the recipeID of a cloud recipe. Example manual cooking 15 minutes at 180 degrees: `[15,180,1,false,0,300,\"M0\"]`."
